  "title": "Admission Procedure - JSA College of Agriculture and Technology",
  "text": "Admission Open for the Academic Year 2026-2027 UG Courses And PG Courses   **     All the aspiring students are requested to enrol your online registration in TNAU & also      to enrol in our college     **     \"JSA COLLEGE OF AGRICULTURE AND TECHNOLOGY\" Located In the National Highways (Chennai to Trichy) ,Avatti, Tholudur, Cuddalore (Dist.), Tamil Nadu – 606 108      **     Contact – +91 9361 909 163/ +91 73050 57759/ +91 9566 223 456/ +91 9443373325/ +91 93608 23456     **    Accredited by Indian Council of Agricultural Research (ICAR) ** State level No.1 Leading Agriculture College for Research , Innovation, Creativity and Discipline      **     Our Alumni got 100% placement in Competitive exams of IAS, Central, State Governments and Banks     **     The Students are doing PG in various reputed Indian & International Universities.\nJSA COLLEGE OF AGRICULTURE AND TECHNOLOGY\n( Accredited by Indian Council of Agricultural Research (ICAR), New Delhi-110 012.)\n(Affiliated to Tamil Nadu Agricultural University, Coimbatore-3)\nThe College is approved by Government of Tamilnadu Vide G.O.No.198 dt.28.09.2015\nPart of JSA GROUP OF INSTITUTIONS\nMa.Podaiyur, Avatti Post & Bus Stop, Ulundurpet to Trichy NH-Onroad, Cuddalore (Dt), Tamil Nadu – 606 108.\nOur Group \nHome\nAbout us \nAcademics \nAdmission \nInfrastructure \nFaculty \nStudent Welfare \nEvents \nGallery\nNews \nAchievements \nOnline Payment\nContact Us\nADMISSION PROCEDURE\n\nTotal number of students admitted for B.Sc. (Hons) (Agriculture) is 175 every year. Of the total sanctioned strength, 65% of the seats will be admitted through TNAU single window system and the remaining 35% by the management adopting the eligibility criteria.Candidates seeking admission under Government quota and management quota should apply online to Tamil Nadu Agricultural University, Coimbatore , visit tnau admission 2022-23 for tnau counselling date 2022 details and tnau admission www.tnau.ac.in 2022.\n\nIn addition, application form for admission to the management quota can be obtained, in person, from the Secretary, JSA College of Agriculture and Technology, Avatti,Thozhuthur,CuddaloreDistrict by paying an application fee of Rs. 1,000/- or through post by sending a request letter enclosing a demand draft for Rs. 1,000/- in favour of “JSA College of Agriculture and Technology” payable at Indian Bank Vepur towards the cost of application form.\n\nThe application form may also be downloaded from our website. Click Here to download the application form. If the downloaded application is used, it should be submitted in person to the Secretary, JSA College of Agriculture and Technology, Avatti along with the application fee of Rs. 1,000/- paid as cash or as Demand Draft, as stated above.\n\n\t\nContact us\n\t\n \n   Telephone\n\n\n+91 93619 09163\n+91 73050 57758\n+91 96599 70832\n+91 93608 23456\n   Email\n\n\nsvtrust.educ@gmail.com\ndeanjsacat@tnau.ac.in\njsacatoffice2@gmail.com\n   Reach us\n\n\n\nJSA College of Agriculture and Technology,\nAvatti, Tholudur, Cuddalore (District),\nTamil Nadu – 606 108.\n\n   Connect with Us\n\n\nJSA GROUP OF INSTITUTIONS\n  Facebook\n  Instagram\n  Youtube\nVisitors : 66\n\n© CopyRights All Rights Reserved 2026 - Designed by - Shri Venkateswara Trust",
